WEBVTT

00:09.413 --> 00:10.896
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.896 --> 00:12.689
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:12.689 --> 00:14.137
- I CAN'’T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:14.137 --> 00:15.965
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:15.965 --> 00:19.103
- ♪ OHH... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:19.103 --> 00:21.206
♪ WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:21.206 --> 00:23.344
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:23.344 --> 00:25.275
- ♪ ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:25.275 --> 00:27.172
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:27.172 --> 00:29.275
- ♪ IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你所希望的 ♪

00:29.275 --> 00:31.310
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:31.310 --> 00:33.379
- ♪ THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH ♪
- ♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:33.379 --> 00:35.172
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
- READY?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:35.172 --> 00:37.206
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:37.206 --> 00:39.137
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.137 --> 00:41.103
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:41.103 --> 00:42.344
- SPONGEBOB
- 海绵宝宝

00:42.344 --> 00:44.655
SQUAREPANTS!
方裤！

00:44.655 --> 00:47.103
[laughing]
[笑]

00:47.103 --> 00:49.413
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:49.413 --> 00:50.448
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

01:06.000 --> 01:10.655
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

01:10.655 --> 01:12.068
creak!
吱吱！

01:12.068 --> 01:13.586
thump!
扑通！

01:13.586 --> 01:16.862
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

01:16.862 --> 01:18.517
clank!
铮铮！

01:18.517 --> 01:21.551
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

01:21.551 --> 01:22.758
thump!
扑通！

01:22.758 --> 01:26.103
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

01:26.103 --> 01:27.586
clank!
铮铮！

01:27.586 --> 01:32.137
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

01:32.137 --> 01:34.689
[laughter continues]
[笑声继续]

01:41.275 --> 01:44.689
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

01:44.689 --> 01:47.206
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

01:51.896 --> 01:54.000
- STOP...PLAYING...
- 停止...玩...

01:54.000 --> 01:57.000
IN MY YARD!
在我的院子里！

01:57.000 --> 02:00.344
- OHH, WE'’RE NOT PLAYING
IN YOUR YARD, SQUIDWARD.
- 哦，我们不玩了
在你的院子里，章鱼哥。

02:00.344 --> 02:02.862
WE'’RE PLAYING IN OURYARDS.
我们正在我们的院子里玩耍。

02:02.862 --> 02:05.517
WE'’RE JUST USING YOUR YARD
AS A WALKWAY.
我们只是使用你的院子
作为走道。

02:05.517 --> 02:09.034
- NO OFFENSE, BUT YOUR YARD
GARGLES TARTAR SAUCE.
- 无意冒犯，但你的院子
漱口塔塔酱。

02:09.034 --> 02:10.758
- WELL, PICK ONE,
- 好吧，选一个，

02:10.758 --> 02:14.000
AND LEAVE MYYARD
OUT OF IT!
离开我的院子
没了！

02:14.000 --> 02:17.068
- OH, OH, OH, OH, OH!
I'’M GOOD AT CHOOSING!
- 哦，哦，哦，哦，哦！
我很擅长选择！

02:17.068 --> 02:19.689
HMM...
唔...

02:19.689 --> 02:22.172
HUMMM...
嗯……

02:22.172 --> 02:26.034
LET'’S PLAY...IN...
让我们一起玩...

02:26.034 --> 02:31.448
MM...MM...MM...
MM……MM……MM……
MM……MM……MM……
MM……MM……MM……
MM……MM……MM……
MM……MM……MM……
MM……MM……MM……
MM……MM……MM……

02:31.448 --> 02:33.137
SPONGEBOB'’S YARD!
海绵宝宝的院子！

02:33.137 --> 02:35.689
NO, PATRICK'’S!
NO, SPONGEBOB'’S!
不，帕特里克的！
不，是海绵宝宝的！

02:35.689 --> 02:38.310
OH!
[sobbing]
哦！
[抽泣]

02:38.310 --> 02:41.103
I'’M TERRIBLE AT CHOOSING.
我很难选择。

02:41.103 --> 02:43.137
SQUIDWARD, YOU CHOOSE.
章鱼哥，你选择。

02:43.137 --> 02:45.862
- I CHOOSE PATRICK...
- 我选择帕特里克...

02:45.862 --> 02:48.379
TO PLAY IN PATRICK'’S YARD...
在帕特里克的院子里玩耍......

02:48.379 --> 02:50.862
AND SPONGEBOB...
还有海绵宝宝...

02:50.862 --> 02:53.172
IN SPONGEBOB'’S YARD...
在海绵宝宝的院子里……

02:53.172 --> 02:56.275
AND NOBODY...
没有人...

03:04.103 --> 03:06.482
IN HERE!
在这里！

03:09.000 --> 03:10.689
- SPONGEBOB!
- 海绵宝宝！

03:10.689 --> 03:12.724
- PATRICK!
- 帕特里克！

03:12.724 --> 03:15.448
[both panting]
[两人都气喘吁吁]

03:15.448 --> 03:16.724
- SPONGEBOB!
- 海绵宝宝！

03:16.724 --> 03:18.034
- PATRICK!
- 帕特里克！

03:18.034 --> 03:20.517
[both panting]
[两人都气喘吁吁]

03:20.517 --> 03:21.620
- SPONGEBOB!
- 海绵宝宝！

03:21.620 --> 03:23.517
- PATRICK!
- 帕特里克！

03:23.517 --> 03:27.275
[both panting]
[两人都气喘吁吁]

03:27.275 --> 03:29.827
[gasps]
THE ROAD!
[喘气]
道路！

03:32.172 --> 03:33.379
[boat engines revving]
[船发动机转速]

03:33.379 --> 03:34.448
[horns honking]
[喇叭鸣响]

03:34.448 --> 03:36.000
[shivering]
[发抖]

03:36.000 --> 03:37.758
PATRICK,
WHAT ARE WE GONNA DO?
帕特里克，
我们要做什么？

03:37.758 --> 03:40.758
- I'’LL MAIL MYSELF
TO YOUR HOUSE.
- 我会自己邮寄
到你家。

03:40.758 --> 03:43.000
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

03:43.000 --> 03:44.137
fwoomp!
呜呜！

03:44.137 --> 03:45.689
[mailbox creaking]
[邮箱吱吱作响]

03:45.689 --> 03:47.620
[explosion booms]
[爆炸声]

03:47.620 --> 03:50.068
- SIT TIGHT, PATRICK.
I'’M COMING TO GET YOU.
- 坐稳，帕特里克。
我来接你了。

03:52.103 --> 03:54.965
[moaning]
[呻吟]

03:54.965 --> 03:56.620
OH!
哦！

03:56.620 --> 03:57.689
- HEY, SPONGEBOB.
- 嘿，海绵宝宝。

03:57.689 --> 03:58.344
- HEY, PATRICK.
- 嘿，帕特里克。

04:04.103 --> 04:05.379
[birds tweeting]
[鸟鸣声]

04:05.379 --> 04:07.000
PATRICK, CALL ME.
帕特里克，给我打电话。

04:07.000 --> 04:08.103
- OKAY!
- 好的！

04:08.103 --> 04:12.758
[both panting]
[两人都气喘吁吁]

04:12.758 --> 04:13.965
[phone rings]
[电话铃声]

04:13.965 --> 04:15.137
- SQUAREPANTS RESIDENCE.
- 方丈住宅。

04:15.137 --> 04:17.068
- WHAT ARE WE GONNA DO?
- 我们要做什么？

04:17.068 --> 04:22.034
- HMM...HAVE WE EVER DUG
A TUNNEL BETWEEN OUR TWO HOUSES?
- 嗯...我们挖过吗
我们两栋房子之间有隧道吗？

04:22.034 --> 04:23.379
- NO.
- 不。

04:23.379 --> 04:24.620
[dial tones humming]
[拨号音嗡嗡声]

04:24.620 --> 04:27.620
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

04:27.620 --> 04:35.137
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:45.310 --> 04:47.068
- SPONGEBOB?
- PATRICK?
- 海绵宝宝？
- 帕特里克？

04:47.068 --> 04:48.724
both: WE DID IT!
两人：我们做到了！

04:48.724 --> 04:50.000
- TAG.
YOU'’RE IT.
- 标签。
就是你了。

04:50.000 --> 04:51.586
- [guffawing]
- [狂笑]

04:51.586 --> 04:54.275
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

04:54.275 --> 04:55.344
TAG.
YOU'’RE IT!
标签。
就是你了！

04:55.344 --> 04:57.275
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

04:57.275 --> 04:58.344
- TAG.
YOU'’RE IT.
- 标签。
就是你了。

04:58.344 --> 05:00.551
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

05:00.551 --> 05:02.172
- TAG.
YOU'’RE IT!
- 标签。
就是你了！

05:02.172 --> 05:04.724
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

05:07.793 --> 05:09.379
- PEEKABOO!
I SEE YOU.
- PEEKABOO!
我看见你。

05:09.379 --> 05:10.206
[Patrick laughs]
[帕特里克笑]

05:16.793 --> 05:18.103
- YOU'’RE IT.
- YOU'’RE IT!
- 就是你了。
- 就是你了！

05:18.103 --> 05:20.862
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

05:20.862 --> 05:23.103
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

05:23.103 --> 05:25.655
[laughter continues]
[笑声继续]

05:28.724 --> 05:31.827
MUST...BLOCK...OUT...NOISE.
必须...阻挡...噪音。

05:31.827 --> 05:34.275
splat!
啪！

05:34.275 --> 05:36.137
[laughter continues]
[笑声继续]

05:36.137 --> 05:38.689
- [whooping]
- [呼喊]

05:38.689 --> 05:41.103
- ♪ LA-LA-LA-LA-LA-LA-LA ♪
- ♪ 拉-拉-拉-拉-拉-拉-拉 ♪

05:41.103 --> 05:42.827
- KNOCK, KNOCK.
- 敲，敲。

05:42.827 --> 05:44.689
- WHO'’S THERE?
- 谁在那里？

05:44.689 --> 05:45.965
- I DON'’T KNOW.
- 我不知道。

05:45.965 --> 05:47.517
[laughing]
[笑]

05:47.517 --> 05:50.413
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

05:50.413 --> 05:52.586
[muttering angrily]
[愤怒地嘀咕]

05:52.586 --> 05:56.758
I THOUGHT I TOLD YOU TWO
TO STAY OFF MY...
我想我已经告诉过你们两个了
为了远离我的...

05:56.758 --> 05:57.344
YARD.
院子。

05:59.793 --> 06:03.620
[Patrick snickering]
[帕特里克窃笑]

06:03.620 --> 06:05.551
PATRICK.
帕特里克。

06:05.551 --> 06:06.931
[grunts]
[咕哝]

06:06.931 --> 06:08.310
PATRICK, WOULD YOU SHUT--
帕特里克，你能闭嘴吗——

06:10.482 --> 06:11.689
WHERE IS HE?
他在哪里？

06:11.689 --> 06:14.413
[SpongeBob cackling]
[海绵宝宝咯咯笑]

06:14.413 --> 06:16.413
SPONGEBOB.
海绵宝宝。

06:16.413 --> 06:17.827
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

06:17.827 --> 06:19.206
[SpongeBob cackling]
[海绵宝宝咯咯笑]

06:19.206 --> 06:21.379
SPONGEBOB, I AM TRYING TO...
海绵宝宝，我正在努力……

06:21.379 --> 06:22.413
SLEEP?
睡觉？

06:22.413 --> 06:22.965
- WAHOO!
- 哇呼！

06:26.310 --> 06:28.620
[Patrick laughing]
[帕特里克大笑]

06:28.620 --> 06:31.724
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

06:31.724 --> 06:33.793
- AHA!
- 啊哈！

06:33.793 --> 06:34.827
HEY, GARY.
嘿，加里。

06:34.827 --> 06:36.172
- [meows]
- [喵]

06:36.172 --> 06:38.344
- WHERE ARE THOSE TWO MORONS?
- 那两个白痴在哪里？

06:38.344 --> 06:40.310
[SpongeBob snickering]
[海绵宝宝偷笑]

06:40.310 --> 06:41.827
- [groaning angrily]
- [愤怒地呻吟]

06:41.827 --> 06:45.344
[Patrick laughing]
[帕特里克大笑]

06:45.344 --> 06:51.206
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

06:51.206 --> 06:53.000
[groaning]
[呻吟]

06:53.000 --> 06:57.172
WHERE...ARE...THEY?
他们在哪里？

06:57.172 --> 06:59.758
- [laughing]
- [笑]

06:59.758 --> 07:00.862
doink!
多克！

07:00.862 --> 07:02.413
OOH!
哦！

07:02.413 --> 07:04.586
PATRICK,
CHECK OUT THOSE ROOTS.
帕特里克，
检查一下这些根源。

07:04.586 --> 07:06.827
- THEY'’RE DANCING.
- 他们在跳舞。

07:06.827 --> 07:08.310
- DO LIKE THE ROOTS DO,
- 像根一样做，

07:08.310 --> 07:10.793
AND DO THE DIRT DANCE, BABY!
宝贝，跳土舞吧！

07:10.793 --> 07:12.793
boing!
boing!
噗！
噗！

07:12.793 --> 07:15.482
thunk!
thunk!
咚！
咚！

07:15.482 --> 07:17.655
boing!
boing!
噗！
噗！

07:17.655 --> 07:19.551
thunk!
thunk!
咚！
咚！

07:19.551 --> 07:21.448
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

07:28.344 --> 07:30.137
boing!
boing! boing!
噗！
噗！噗！

07:30.137 --> 07:32.275
[rocks clunking]
[岩石叮当作响]

07:32.275 --> 07:34.344
- SQUIDWARD'’S HOUSE
WANTS TO PLAY TOO.
- 章鱼哥之家
也想玩。

07:34.344 --> 07:36.103
- MY HOUSE.
- 我的房子。

07:38.172 --> 07:41.689
[muttering angrily]
[愤怒地嘀咕]

07:41.689 --> 07:43.689
- AW, SQUIDWARD'’S HOUSE
- AW，《章鱼哥之家》

07:43.689 --> 07:45.896
SOUNDS LIKE IT HAS
AN UPSET TUMMY.
听起来像是有的
肚子不舒服。

07:45.896 --> 07:48.827
- MUST HAVE BEEN SOMETHING
THAT IT ATE.
- 一定是有什么东西
它吃了。

07:48.827 --> 07:49.965
- IT ATE SQUIDWARD.
- 它吃了章鱼哥。

07:49.965 --> 07:51.000
- THAT'’D DO IT.
- 就可以了。

07:51.000 --> 07:52.862
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

07:52.862 --> 07:55.620
I KNEW YOU TWO REPROBATES
WERE BEHIND THIS.
我认识你们两个恶棍
我们是这一切的幕后黑手。

07:55.620 --> 07:57.620
- YEAH!
WE'’RE REPROBATES!
- 是的！
我们是败类！

07:57.620 --> 07:59.000
- THAT WAS AN INSULT.
- 这是一种侮辱。

07:59.000 --> 08:01.758
- AND WE'’RE INSULTED!
- 我们被侮辱了！

08:01.758 --> 08:04.206
- WHY WERE YOU DIGGING
UNDER MY YARD?
- 你为什么要挖
在我的院子下面？

08:04.206 --> 08:06.172
- YOU TOLD US NOT TO WALK
ON YOUR YARD,
- 你告诉我们不要走路
在你的院子里，

08:06.172 --> 08:07.482
SO WE WALKED UNDER IT.
所以我们就从它下面走过去。

08:07.482 --> 08:10.137
- BUT YOU BURIED MY HOUSE!
- 但你埋葬了我的房子！

08:10.137 --> 08:11.655
- NO NEED TO THANK US.
- 无需感谢我们。

08:11.655 --> 08:12.896
- THANK YOU?
- 谢谢你？

08:12.896 --> 08:14.000
- YOU'’RE WELCOME.
- 不客气。

08:14.000 --> 08:15.482
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

08:15.482 --> 08:16.862
- MISSED.
- 错过了。

08:16.862 --> 08:19.172
- SOMEBODY WANTS TO PLAY TAG.
- 有人想玩双打游戏。

08:19.172 --> 08:20.379
- TAG!
YOU'’RE IT!
- 标签！
就是你了！

08:20.379 --> 08:21.620
[laughing]
[笑]

08:21.620 --> 08:22.689
- NOT IT!
- 不是它！

08:22.689 --> 08:23.758
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

08:23.758 --> 08:26.758
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

08:26.758 --> 08:28.000
[groaning]
[呻吟]

08:28.000 --> 08:29.275
- WHEEEE!
- 哎哟！

08:32.000 --> 08:34.000
[laughing]
[笑]

08:39.379 --> 08:41.206
crash!
碰撞！

08:41.206 --> 08:42.482
- SQUIDWARD WINS!
- 章鱼哥获胜！

08:46.000 --> 08:48.758
- NOW...YOU'’RE GOING TO PLAY
A NEW GAME
- 现在...你要开始玩了
新游戏

08:48.758 --> 08:51.689
CALLED "DIGGING OUT MY HOUSE."
叫做“挖出我的房子”。

08:51.689 --> 08:53.275
- OH, BOY!
- 哦，孩子！

08:53.275 --> 08:55.000
[shovels clank]
[铲子叮当作响]

08:55.000 --> 08:57.827
- AND I'’M GONNA PLAY
"SIT AND RELAX"
- 我要玩
“坐下来放松”

08:57.827 --> 08:59.793
UNTIL YOU'’RE FINISHED.
直到完成。

08:59.793 --> 09:02.206
BARNACLE BRAINS.
藤壶脑。

09:02.206 --> 09:04.000
[sighs deeply]
[深深叹息]

09:04.000 --> 09:05.724
[glass shatters]
[玻璃碎裂]

09:05.724 --> 09:06.655
splat!
啪！

09:08.827 --> 09:10.344
[groans]
[呻吟]

09:13.655 --> 09:15.413
thunk!
thunk! thunk!
咚！
咚！咚！

09:15.413 --> 09:17.827
[dirt rumbling]
[泥土隆隆声]

09:17.827 --> 09:19.034
[slurping]
[发出声音]

09:19.034 --> 09:20.137
AHHH!
啊啊啊！

09:20.137 --> 09:21.172
[cup shatters]
[杯子碎裂]

09:21.172 --> 09:22.827
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

09:22.827 --> 09:24.206
- HI, SQUIDWARD.
- 嗨，章鱼哥。

09:24.206 --> 09:26.758
[dirt rumbling]
[泥土隆隆声]

09:31.310 --> 09:32.620
- [groans angrily]
- [愤怒地呻吟]

09:32.620 --> 09:33.862
- YUH-OH.
- 呃哦。

09:33.862 --> 09:35.862
- I'’M WARNING YOU,
- 我警告你，

09:35.862 --> 09:37.896
IF YOU DON'’T PUT MY HOUSE
BACK WHERE IT BELONGS
如果你不把我的房子
回到它所属的地方

09:37.896 --> 09:42.517
BY THE COUNT OF THREE...
数到三……

09:42.517 --> 09:44.137
THREE.
三。

09:44.137 --> 09:45.724
I AM GONNA GRIND YOU
INTO CHUM!
我要磨碎你
进入密友！

09:45.724 --> 09:47.655
ONE...
一...

09:47.655 --> 09:49.724
- [screams]
HE'’S COUNTING!
- [尖叫]
他正在数数！

09:49.724 --> 09:51.620
ANYTHING BUT COUNTING!
除了计数之外什么都可以！

09:51.620 --> 09:53.517
QUICK, SPONGEBOB!
快点，海绵宝宝！

09:53.517 --> 09:55.448
DIG FOR YOUR LIFE!
为你的生活而挖掘！

09:55.448 --> 09:57.137
- TWO...
- 二...

09:57.137 --> 09:59.655
- HE'’S ALREADY
AT NUMBER TWO.
- 他已经了
位居第二。

09:59.655 --> 10:04.034
WHO KNOWS HOW MANY NUMBERS
WE HAVE UNTIL HE REACHES THREE?
谁知道有多少个数字
我们有直到他三岁为止？

10:04.034 --> 10:05.103
- THREE!
- 三！

10:05.103 --> 10:06.172
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

10:06.172 --> 10:07.586
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

10:07.586 --> 10:09.689
[both whimpering]
[两人都呜咽]

10:09.689 --> 10:12.482
- [grumbling angrily]
- [愤怒地抱怨]

10:12.482 --> 10:14.000
thump!
扑通！

10:14.000 --> 10:15.586
[both whimpering]
[两人都呜咽]

10:15.586 --> 10:16.931
[ground rumbling]
[地面隆隆声]

10:16.931 --> 10:17.965
shoomp!
嘭！

10:17.965 --> 10:19.275
shoomp!
嘭！

10:19.275 --> 10:21.068
- AHH, SCARY, SCARY, SCARY!
- 啊，可怕，可怕，可怕！

10:21.068 --> 10:22.793
- [mumbling angrily]
- [愤怒地咕哝]

10:22.793 --> 10:25.068
[buildings rumbling
and creaking]
[建筑物隆隆作响
和吱吱声]

10:25.068 --> 10:27.793
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

10:27.793 --> 10:29.827
- SCARY, SCARY,
SCARY, AHH!
- 可怕，可怕，
可怕，啊！

10:29.827 --> 10:31.034
- [grumbling angrily]
- [愤怒地抱怨]

10:31.034 --> 10:32.413
[building rumbling]
[建筑物隆隆声]

10:32.413 --> 10:34.413
fwoomp!
呜呜！

10:34.413 --> 10:36.344
- YES!
- 是的！

10:36.344 --> 10:39.965
NOW THE CHUM BUCKET
IS THE ONLY RESTAURANT IN TOWN.
现在是密友桶
是镇上唯一的餐厅。

10:39.965 --> 10:41.000
[building rumbling]
[建筑物隆隆声]

10:41.000 --> 10:42.137
fwoomp!
呜呜！

10:42.137 --> 10:43.344
NUTS.
坚果。

10:43.344 --> 10:44.448
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

10:44.448 --> 10:45.448
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

10:45.448 --> 10:47.000
- NO!
- 不！

10:47.000 --> 10:49.862
[panting]
MUST...DIG.
[气喘吁吁]
必须...挖掘。

10:49.862 --> 10:51.896
[pickax clanking]
[镐叮当作响]

10:51.896 --> 10:53.896
GAH!
WHOA!
嘎啊！
哇啊！

10:53.896 --> 10:56.586
THE ROCK'’S TOO HARD.
岩石太硬了。

10:56.586 --> 10:59.034
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

10:59.034 --> 11:02.482
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

11:02.482 --> 11:03.724
[growling]
[咆哮]

11:03.724 --> 11:05.758
[both whimpering]
[两人都呜咽]

11:05.758 --> 11:07.724
[growling]
[咆哮]

11:07.724 --> 11:09.172
[teeth chattering]
[牙齿打战]

11:09.172 --> 11:12.310
[growling]
[咆哮]

11:12.310 --> 11:15.793
YOU...TWO...MORONS
你们……两个……白痴

11:15.793 --> 11:18.724
SUNK MY HOUSE!
击沉我的房子！

11:18.724 --> 11:22.000
both: WE'’RE SORRY!
两人：我们很抱歉！

11:22.000 --> 11:23.448
- I'’M GONNA...
- 我要...

11:23.448 --> 11:26.448
[ground rumbling]
[地面隆隆声]

11:26.448 --> 11:27.655
UH...OH.
呃...哦。

11:27.655 --> 11:32.413
[rumbling continues]
[隆隆声继续]

11:32.413 --> 11:33.931
fwoomp!
呜呜！

11:33.931 --> 11:35.068
[door squeaks]
[门吱吱作响]

11:35.068 --> 11:36.931
- [inhales deeply]
- [深吸一口气]

11:36.931 --> 11:38.931
AHH!
啊啊！

11:38.931 --> 11:42.379
[pickaxes clinking]
[镐叮当作响]

11:42.379 --> 11:44.172
GOOD MORNING, SQUIDWARD.
早上好，章鱼哥。

11:44.172 --> 11:46.827
ANOTHER BEE-EAUTIFUL DAY
UNDER BIKINI BOTTOM.
又是美丽的一天
比基尼下装。

11:49.793 --> 11:51.068
- I HATE NEIGHBORS.
- 我讨厌邻居。

12:03.793 --> 12:05.655
- HI-YA!
- 你好！

12:05.655 --> 12:07.517
HI-YA!
YA!
你好！
是啊！

12:07.517 --> 12:08.827
YA-YA-YA-YA-YA-YA!
亚-亚-亚-亚-亚-亚！

12:08.827 --> 12:10.620
YA!
TA-DA!
是啊！
达达！

12:10.620 --> 12:12.793
A GIFT IN YOUR LIKENESS.
与您相似的礼物。

12:12.793 --> 12:14.241
- [meows]
- [喵]

12:14.241 --> 12:15.655
- '’CAUSE YOU'’RE SO SWEET.
- 因为你太可爱了。

12:15.655 --> 12:17.310
GET IT?
得到它？

12:17.310 --> 12:18.896
'’CAUSE PINEAPPLES
ARE SWEET,
因为菠萝
很甜蜜，

12:18.896 --> 12:20.827
AND YOU ARE SWEET ALSO
AS WELL.
你也很可爱
还有。

12:20.827 --> 12:21.931
GET IT?
得到它？

12:21.931 --> 12:26.068
[cackling]
[咯咯笑]

12:26.068 --> 12:27.931
[flies buzzing]
[苍蝇嗡嗡声]

12:27.931 --> 12:30.172
[laughter continues]
[笑声继续]

12:30.172 --> 12:31.275
[gasps]
[喘气]

12:31.275 --> 12:32.586
[gagging]
[作呕]

12:32.586 --> 12:34.310
- HEY, BUDDY.
- 嘿，伙计。

12:34.310 --> 12:36.793
YOU STILL GOT
THAT BUCKET OF CHEESE?
你还有
那桶奶酪？

12:36.793 --> 12:38.689
- [gasping]
- [喘气]

12:38.689 --> 12:42.000
- OH, NO.
HE'’S...NOT RIGHT!
- 哦，不。
他……不对！

12:42.000 --> 12:44.000
DON'’T WORRY, PAL.
I'’LL HELP YOU.
别担心，朋友。
我会帮助你。

12:44.000 --> 12:45.000
smack!
咂！

12:45.000 --> 12:47.724
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

12:47.724 --> 12:49.068
[fly buzzing]
[苍蝇嗡嗡声]

12:49.068 --> 12:50.206
- BUDDY!
YOU OKAY?
- 伙计！
你还好吗？

12:50.206 --> 12:51.551
- HUH.
- 嗯。

12:51.551 --> 12:53.551
PATRICK, THANK YOU SO MUCH.
帕特里克，非常感谢你。

12:53.551 --> 12:55.482
IF IT WASN'’T FOR YOUR TREMENDOUS
GORILLA STRENGTH,
如果不是因为你的伟大
大猩猩的力量，

12:55.482 --> 12:57.551
I WOULD'’VE BEEN A GONER.
我会死的。

12:57.551 --> 12:59.689
IF THERE'’S ANYTHING I CAN DO
TO RETURN THE FAVOR--
如果有什么我能做的
报恩——

12:59.689 --> 13:01.655
ANYTHING AT ALL--
任何事情——

13:01.655 --> 13:03.310
YOU JUST LET ME KNOW.
你只要让我知道就可以了。

13:03.310 --> 13:05.931
ANYWAY, BACK
TO MY KARATE EXERCISES.
无论如何，回来
我的空手道练习。

13:05.931 --> 13:08.310
OH, AND HELP YOURSELF
TO THE CHEESE BUCKET.
哦，自助吧
到奶酪桶。

13:08.310 --> 13:09.793
THANKS AGAIN, BUDDY!
再次感谢，伙计！

13:09.793 --> 13:12.379
HI-YA!
你好！

13:12.379 --> 13:13.793
HI-YA!
你好！

13:13.793 --> 13:15.827
- [gulps]
- [吞咽]

13:15.827 --> 13:17.448
- HI-YA!
- 你好！

13:17.448 --> 13:18.758
- [gulps]
- [吞咽]

13:18.758 --> 13:20.275
- PHEW!
- HEY!
- 唷！
- 嘿！

13:20.275 --> 13:22.000
I WANT TO LEARN
HOW TO DO THAT.
我想学习
怎么做。

13:22.000 --> 13:23.206
- WELL, WHAT?
YOU MEAN KARATE?
- 嗯，什么？
你是说空手道吗？

13:23.206 --> 13:24.413
- UH-HUH.
- 呃哈。

13:24.413 --> 13:26.000
- OH, PATRICK, PATRICK,
- 哦，帕特里克，帕特里克，

13:26.000 --> 13:28.034
PATRICK,
MY DEAR, DEAR FRIEND,
帕特里克，
我亲爱的朋友，

13:28.034 --> 13:31.344
KARATE IS A DELICATE ART,
A SKILL THAT TAKES YEARS TO--
空手道是一门精致的艺术，
一项需要数年时间才能掌握的技能——

13:31.344 --> 13:33.689
- IF I RECALL CORRECTLY,
- 如果我没记错的话

13:33.689 --> 13:36.862
I SEEM TO REMEMBER SAVING
YOUR LIFE A FEW MINUTES AGO.
我似乎记得保存
几分钟前你的生活。

13:36.862 --> 13:38.655
- Y-YEAH, HOWEVER--
- 是-是的，但是--

13:38.655 --> 13:40.862
- AND I ALSO REMEMBER
YOU SAYING
- 我也记得
你说

13:40.862 --> 13:44.586
IF THERE'’S ANYTHING YOU CAN DO
TO RETURN THE FAVOR--
如果有什么你可以做的
报恩——

13:44.586 --> 13:46.724
ANYTHING AT ALL--
任何事情——

13:46.724 --> 13:48.620
TO LET YOU KNOW.
让您知道。

13:48.620 --> 13:50.448
- OH, I DID SAY THAT,
PATRICK,
- 哦，我确实说过，
帕特里克，

13:50.448 --> 13:53.034
BUT, WELL,
KARATE IS ABOUT FINESSE,
但是，好吧，
空手道讲究技巧，

13:53.034 --> 13:54.896
NOT SO MUCH BRUTE STRENGTH.
没有那么多的蛮力。

13:54.896 --> 13:57.413
YOU SEE, THERE'’S SO MUCH
YOU DON'’T KNOW.
你看，有这么多
你不知道。

13:57.413 --> 14:01.068
YOU HAVE NOT EVEN SCRATCHED
THE SURFACE OF THE SURFACE.
你甚至还没有刮过
表面的表面。

14:01.068 --> 14:02.448
- THEN TEACH ME.
- 那么教我。

14:02.448 --> 14:03.655
- AS YOU WISH.
- 如你所愿。

14:03.655 --> 14:05.586
JUST REMEMBER ONE THING.
请记住一件事。

14:05.586 --> 14:08.275
WITH POWER
COMES RESPONSIBILITY.
拥有力量
责任随之而来。

14:08.275 --> 14:11.482
- OH, YEAH, MAMA!
- 哦，是的，妈妈！

14:11.482 --> 14:13.413
- OKAY, LET'’S START OFF SIMPLE.
- 好吧，让我们从简单的开始吧。

14:13.413 --> 14:16.103
THIS IS A BASIC MOVE CALLED
THE INVERTED WHIRLPOOL.
这是一个基本动作，称为
倒置的漩涡。

14:16.103 --> 14:18.206
- INVERTEE WHIRPEE,
GOT IT.
- 倒转惠尔比，
明白了。

14:26.206 --> 14:27.655
WHOO-HOO!
呼呼！

14:27.655 --> 14:29.586
THAT WAS AWESOME!
太棒了！

14:29.586 --> 14:30.551
- THINK YOU CAN HANDLE THAT?
- YEAH, YEAH, YEAH!
- 你认为你能应付吗？
- 是啊，是啊，是啊！

14:36.275 --> 14:37.793
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

14:37.793 --> 14:40.862
[laughing]
[笑]

14:40.862 --> 14:42.448
OH, YEAH!
OH, YEAH!
哦，是啊！
哦，是啊！

14:42.448 --> 14:46.275
[laughing]
[笑]

14:46.275 --> 14:47.620
HEY!
嘿！

14:47.620 --> 14:49.482
HOW DO YOU STOP THIS THING?
你如何阻止这件事？

14:49.482 --> 14:52.103
- NEPTUNE'’S TROUSERS,
WHAT'’S THAT?
- 海王星的裤子，
那是什么？

14:52.103 --> 14:53.310
[screaming]
[尖叫]

14:53.310 --> 14:55.965
- WHOA-WHOA.
- 哇-哇。

14:55.965 --> 14:58.413
- NOW, THIS IS VERY EASY.
WATCH CLOSELY.
- 现在，这非常简单。
仔细观察。

14:58.413 --> 14:59.793
ting!
婷！

14:59.793 --> 15:01.413
AHH...AHH.
[farts]
啊啊……啊啊。
[放屁]

15:01.413 --> 15:03.103
YOU GOT IT?
- DEFINITELY.
你明白了吗？
- 确实。

15:03.103 --> 15:05.586
ting!
婷！

15:05.586 --> 15:07.275
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

15:07.275 --> 15:09.482
AY-YI-YI-YI-YI-YI!
啊，一，一，一，一，一！

15:09.482 --> 15:10.586
WHOA, WHOA, WHOA,
WHOA, WHOA!
哇，哇，哇，
哇，哇！

15:10.586 --> 15:12.448
splat!
啪！

15:12.448 --> 15:15.379
- PATRICK, I DIDN'’T WANT
TO HAVE TO SAY THIS,
- 帕特里克，我不想
不得不说，

15:15.379 --> 15:18.206
BUT YOU'’RE--
YOU'’RE UNTEACHABLE.
但你是——
你是不可教的。

15:18.206 --> 15:19.862
- WHAT?
I-I-I...
- 什么？
我-我-我...

15:19.862 --> 15:21.379
OH!
BARNACLES!
哦！
藤壶！

15:25.000 --> 15:28.379
- LOOK WHAT YOU DID
TO THIS WALL OF CINDER BLOCKS.
- 看看你做了什么
到这堵煤渣砖墙。

15:28.379 --> 15:32.068
IN ALL MY YEARS OF TRAINING,
I'’VE NEVER SEEN A PERFECT SLICE.
在我多年的训练中，
我从未见过完美的切片。

15:32.068 --> 15:33.931
NO ONE'’S EVER BEEN ABLE
TO EXECUTE
没有人能够做到
执行

15:33.931 --> 15:35.482
SUCH A CLEAN KARATE CHOP
THROUGH SOLID CINDER.
如此干净的空手道斩
通过固体煤渣。

15:35.482 --> 15:36.758
- WOW!
- 哇！

15:36.758 --> 15:37.896
- YOU'’RE A NATURAL,
- 你是一个天生的人，

15:37.896 --> 15:39.068
A KARATE GENIUS.
空手道天才。

15:39.068 --> 15:40.965
- PLAMMO!
- 普拉莫！

15:40.965 --> 15:42.586
- NOW LET'’S PUT YOUR NEW SKILLS
TO THE TEST.
- 现在让我们发挥你的新技能
经受考验。

15:42.586 --> 15:44.896
THIS IS SHARPENED
TEMPERED STEEL.
这是锐化的
回火钢。

15:44.896 --> 15:47.000
NOW, DON'’T BE FRUSTRATED
IF IT TAKES A FEW TRI--
现在，不要沮丧
如果需要几次——

15:47.000 --> 15:48.379
WHOA.
哇哦。

15:48.379 --> 15:51.862
AMAZING!
惊人的！

15:51.862 --> 15:53.862
THIS IS AN ABANDONED
WROUGHT IRON STEAMBOAT,
这是一个废弃的
锻铁汽船，

15:53.862 --> 15:55.172
SOLID AS A ROCK.
坚如磐石。

15:55.172 --> 15:56.827
THINK YOU GOT WHAT IT TAKES?
您认为您已具备所需条件吗？

15:58.413 --> 15:59.862
thwap!
扑通！

15:59.862 --> 16:01.413
EH, BETTER LUCK NEXT TIME.
呃，祝你下次好运。

16:01.413 --> 16:02.655
[ship creaking]
[船嘎吱作响]

16:02.655 --> 16:04.000
- YEAH!
- 是的！

16:04.000 --> 16:06.000
I BET I COULD CHOP ANYTHING.
我打赌我可以砍任何东西。

16:06.000 --> 16:07.034
[baby cooing]
[婴儿咕咕声]

16:07.034 --> 16:08.068
[woman shrieks]
[女人尖叫]

16:08.068 --> 16:09.103
- HIII...
- 十三...

16:09.103 --> 16:10.793
- NOOOOO!
- 不！

16:10.793 --> 16:12.000
WHAT DID I TELL YOU?
我告诉你什么了？

16:12.000 --> 16:14.241
- I'’M A GENIUS?
- 我是天才？

16:14.241 --> 16:15.931
- NOT THAT,
THIS.
- 不是那样的，
这个。

16:15.931 --> 16:19.344
WITH POWER
COMES RESPONSIBILITY.
拥有力量
责任随之而来。

16:19.344 --> 16:20.931
THAT MEANS NO CHOPPING
OF OTHER LIFE-FORMS
这意味着无需砍伐
其他生命形式的

16:20.931 --> 16:22.103
OR THEIR PROPERTY.
或他们的财产。

16:22.103 --> 16:23.379
YOU UNDERSTAND?
你明白吗？

16:23.379 --> 16:24.448
- YYYES!
- GOOD!
- 是的！
- 好的！

16:24.448 --> 16:26.172
[watch beeping]
[注意蜂鸣声]

16:26.172 --> 16:27.413
[gasps]
OH, MAN, I'’M LATE FOR WORK.
[喘气]
哦，伙计，我上班迟到了。

16:27.413 --> 16:28.793
SEE YOU LATER, BUDDY.
再见，伙计。

16:28.793 --> 16:30.482
DON'’T FORGET WHAT I SAID.
不要忘记我说过的话。

16:30.482 --> 16:31.793
- OKAY!
- 好的！

16:31.793 --> 16:32.517
I'’M A GENIUS!
我是个天才！

16:34.655 --> 16:37.655
[funky music]
[时髦音乐]

16:37.655 --> 16:38.827
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

16:38.827 --> 16:40.551
KARATE POWER!
空手道力量！

16:40.551 --> 16:41.689
gulp!
吞口水！

16:44.103 --> 16:45.586
- OH, WHAT'’S THIS?
- 哦，这是什么？

16:45.586 --> 16:47.310
HMM, HAVEN'’T SEEN THIS BEFORE.
嗯，以前没见过这个。

16:47.310 --> 16:48.689
OH, YEAH, MM-HMM.
哦，是的，嗯嗯。

16:48.689 --> 16:49.862
- HEY, LOOK, IT'’S PATRICK!
- 嘿，看，这是帕特里克！

16:49.862 --> 16:51.068
- HIYA, SPONGEBOB.
-嗨，海绵宝宝。

16:51.068 --> 16:52.068
- WHAT ARE YOU DOING--
- 你在干什么 -

16:52.068 --> 16:53.310
- HI-YA!
- 你好！

16:53.310 --> 16:55.413
[glass shatters]
[玻璃碎裂]

16:55.413 --> 16:56.620
- DEAR NEPTUNE!
- 亲爱的海王星！

16:56.620 --> 16:58.310
- GOOD DAY, GENTS.
- 先生们，美好的一天。

16:58.310 --> 17:00.689
UH, SQUIDWARD,
I WOULD LIKE A...HI-YA!
呃，章鱼哥，
我想要一个……嗨！

17:00.689 --> 17:02.896
- A WHAT?
- 什么？

17:02.896 --> 17:05.206
- I SAID ONE KRUSTY COMBO.
- 我说的是一个 Krusty 组合。

17:05.206 --> 17:06.758
DON'’T YOU SPEAK KARATE?
你不会空手道吗？

17:06.758 --> 17:08.206
- [sighs]
HRMM...
- [叹气]
人力资源管理...

17:10.862 --> 17:11.931
- HI-YA!
- 你好！

17:11.931 --> 17:13.310
[tray shatters]
[托盘碎裂]

17:13.310 --> 17:15.793
LOOKS DELISH!
看起来很美味！

17:15.793 --> 17:17.448
- PATRICK, DON'’T YOU THINK
YOU'’RE TAKING
- 帕特里克，你不觉得吗
你正在服用

17:17.448 --> 17:19.413
YOUR PERFECT SLICE
A BIT TOO FAR?
您的完美切片
有点太远了？

17:19.413 --> 17:21.379
- I DON'’T KNOW
WHAT YOU'’RE TALKING ABOUT.
- 我不知道
你在说什么。

17:21.379 --> 17:24.758
YOU WERE THE ONE WHO CALLED ME
A KARATE GEN-I-US.
你就是那个给我打电话的人
美国空手道天才。

17:24.758 --> 17:28.275
AND FRANKLY, I'’M OFFENDED
BY YOUR PREVIOUS ACCUSATION.
坦白说，我很生气
根据您之前的指控。

17:28.275 --> 17:29.793
I DON'’T NEED THIS!
我不需要这个！

17:29.793 --> 17:31.448
I BID YOU GOOD-DIEU.
我向你致敬。

17:31.448 --> 17:32.965
- BUT--BUT--BUT--
-但是--但是--但是--

17:32.965 --> 17:34.931
- NO BUTS!
JUST HANDS.
- 没有屁股！
只是双手。

17:34.931 --> 17:36.068
HI-YA!
你好！

17:36.068 --> 17:37.034
[glass shattering]
[玻璃破碎]

17:37.034 --> 17:38.206
- OHH.
-哦。

17:38.206 --> 17:40.310
[Mr. Krabs groans]
[先生。螃蟹呻吟]

17:40.310 --> 17:43.068
YOU DO REALIZE I'’M TAKING THAT
OUT OF YOUR PAYCHECK.
你确实意识到我正在接受这个
没了你的薪水。

17:43.068 --> 17:46.517
- [moaning]
AND...UH...
- [呻吟]
还有……呃……

17:46.517 --> 17:47.724
SEAWEED SURPRISE!
海藻惊喜！

17:47.724 --> 17:49.448
ALSO, UH...
还有，呃...

17:49.448 --> 17:54.000
MALTED CORAL CRUNCH!
麦芽珊瑚脆片！

17:54.000 --> 17:55.206
OOH-OOH-OOH!
噢-噢-噢！

17:55.206 --> 17:57.620
ALSO, LIPIDS AND CREAM.
还有脂质和奶油。

17:57.620 --> 17:59.241
- WE'’RE ALL OUT.
- 我们都出去了。

17:59.241 --> 18:00.965
IN FACT,
WE'’RE OUT OF EVERYTHING,
事实上，
我们已经一无所有了，

18:00.965 --> 18:05.379
WHICH MEANS
YOU OWE US $86.50.
这意味着
您欠 86.50 美元。

18:05.379 --> 18:08.068
- WHAT DO YOU SAY
TO A TRADE?
- 你说什么
进行交易？

18:08.068 --> 18:10.551
- I SAY PAY UP
BEFORE I CALL THE COPS.
- 我说付钱
在我报警之前。

18:10.551 --> 18:13.344
- YOU DARE REFUSE MY BARTER?
- 你敢拒绝我的易货贸易吗？

18:13.344 --> 18:15.551
THEN ACCEPT MY CHOP!
那就接受我的印章吧！

18:15.551 --> 18:16.724
HI-YA!
你好！

18:16.724 --> 18:19.448
[coins clattering]
[硬币碰撞声]

18:19.448 --> 18:20.482
splat!
啪！

18:20.482 --> 18:22.413
[slurping]
[发出声音]

18:22.413 --> 18:23.586
[shivering]
[发抖]

18:23.586 --> 18:25.965
[teeth chattering]
[牙齿打战]

18:25.965 --> 18:28.000
[ice crackling]
[冰块噼啪作响]

18:28.000 --> 18:29.275
[moans]
[呻吟声]

18:29.275 --> 18:31.724
I DON'’T FEEL SO GOOD.
我感觉不太好。

18:31.724 --> 18:34.068
- AHA!
HAND IN THE TIP JAR AGAIN, EH?
- 啊哈！
再次交出小费罐，嗯？

18:43.103 --> 18:45.000
- [inhales deeply]
- [深吸一口气]

18:45.000 --> 18:47.551
WHAT IS THAT WONDERFUL STENCH?
那是什么美妙的恶臭？

18:47.551 --> 18:48.793
- [munching]
- [咀嚼]

18:48.793 --> 18:50.413
- WHAT YOU GOT THERE?
- 你得到了什么？

18:50.413 --> 18:51.586
- SPINACH
AND CHOCOLATE SPAGHETTI
- 菠菜
和巧克力意大利面

18:51.586 --> 18:52.793
IN CALAMARI SAUCE.
鱿鱼酱。

18:52.793 --> 18:53.758
DO YOU WANT A BITE?
你想咬一口吗？

18:53.758 --> 18:55.068
- NO!
- 不！

18:55.068 --> 18:56.551
IT'’S MORE FUN TO CHOP.
砍起来更有趣。

18:56.551 --> 18:57.965
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

19:00.517 --> 19:02.620
[video game chirping]
[电子游戏叽叽喳喳]

19:02.620 --> 19:04.827
I WIN!
I WIN! I WIN!
我赢了！
我赢了！我赢了！

19:04.827 --> 19:05.275
HI-YA!
HI-YA!
你好！
你好！

19:08.413 --> 19:10.206
- HELP!
HELP!
- 帮助！
帮助！

19:10.206 --> 19:11.482
THERE'’S A MAD CHOPPER
ON THE LOOSE!
有一架疯狂的直升机
逍遥法外！

19:11.482 --> 19:12.827
- MAD CHOPPER?
- 疯狂砍刀？

19:12.827 --> 19:14.310
[gasps]
PATRICK.
[喘气]
帕特里克。

19:14.310 --> 19:16.068
- WE NEED THE COPS, KID.
- 我们需要警察，孩子。

19:16.068 --> 19:17.655
- COPS?
NO, THAT WON'’T BE NECESSARY.
- 警察？
不，那没有必要。

19:17.655 --> 19:18.931
I'’LL HANDLE THIS, CITIZEN.
我会处理这件事，公民。

19:18.931 --> 19:21.172
- DON'’T DO IT, KID.
- 别这么做，孩子。

19:21.172 --> 19:22.379
- UNHAND MY ANKLE, SIR.
- 松开我的脚踝，先生。

19:22.379 --> 19:24.172
MY FRIEND NEEDS ME.
我的朋友需要我。

19:24.172 --> 19:25.551
- YOU DON'’T KNOW
WHAT YOU'’RE DOING.
- 你不知道
你在做什么。

19:25.551 --> 19:27.482
DON'’T WALK OUT THAT DOOR!
不要走出那扇门！

19:27.482 --> 19:30.758
NOOOOOOOOOOOO!
不哦哦哦哦！

19:30.758 --> 19:32.758
[people screaming]
[人们尖叫]

19:32.758 --> 19:34.379
smash!
粉碎！

19:34.379 --> 19:35.448
- PATRICK,
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
- 帕特里克，
你在做什么？

19:35.448 --> 19:37.068
- SPONGEBOB.
- 海绵宝宝。

19:37.068 --> 19:38.413
JUST THE MAN
I WAS LOOKING FOR.
就是这个男人
我正在寻找。

19:38.413 --> 19:39.931
WANTED TO THANK YOU, BUDDY.
我想谢谢你，伙计。

19:39.931 --> 19:41.689
- [mumbling]
- [咕哝]

19:41.689 --> 19:43.655
- FOR TEACHING ME
THE KARATE CHOP, SILLY.
- 为了教我
空手道斩，愚蠢的。

19:43.655 --> 19:45.448
- YOU'’VE GOT TO STOP, BUDDY.
- 你必须停下来，伙计。

19:45.448 --> 19:46.965
YOU'’RE DESTROYING
THE ENTIRE TOWN.
你正在破坏
整个城镇。

19:46.965 --> 19:51.034
- WHOOOOAAAA.
- 哇啊啊啊啊。

19:51.034 --> 19:53.517
- JUST STOP CHOPPING,
OKAY, PATRICK?
- 别再砍了，
好吧，帕特里克？

19:53.517 --> 19:54.758
- YOU GOT IT, BUDDY.
- 你明白了，伙计。

19:54.758 --> 19:56.241
NO MORE KARATE CHOPS.
不再有空手道排骨。

19:58.965 --> 20:00.655
- YOU'’RE STILL CHOPPING!
- 你还在砍！

20:00.655 --> 20:01.827
- I KNOW.
- 我知道。

20:01.827 --> 20:03.000
WEIRD, HUH?
很奇怪吧？

20:03.000 --> 20:04.068
- PATRICK, STOP IT!
- 帕特里克，停下来！

20:04.068 --> 20:06.206
- OH, OKAY.
- 哦好的。

20:06.206 --> 20:09.448
I KNOW.
I'’LL STOP A CHOP WITH A CHOP.
我知道。
我会用斩击停止。

20:09.448 --> 20:12.000
smack!
咂！

20:12.000 --> 20:13.413
- YOU MUST RESIST!
- 你必须抵抗！

20:13.413 --> 20:14.862
- I...
- 我...

20:14.862 --> 20:17.103
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

20:21.034 --> 20:23.000
WAIT UP, PATRICK!
等等，帕特里克！

20:23.000 --> 20:25.172
[gasps]
TRITON'’S TUNIC!
[喘气]
海卫一的外衣！

20:25.172 --> 20:27.000
- HE'’S HEADED STRAIGHT
FOR THE BARG'’N-MART!
- 他径直前进
为了 BARG''N-MART！

20:27.000 --> 20:30.758
[people screaming]
[人们尖叫]

20:30.758 --> 20:32.586
- HI-YA!
HI-YA! YA!
- 你好！
你好！是啊！

20:32.586 --> 20:36.000
NO...NOT THE MUFFIN DISPLAY.
不……不是松饼展示。

20:36.000 --> 20:37.827
AHHH!
啊啊啊！

20:37.827 --> 20:40.620
- THIS JUST IN:
A MADMAN IS CHOPPING EVERYTHING.
- 这只是在：
一个疯子正在砍伐一切。

20:40.620 --> 20:43.413
- NOT THE GIANT-SCREEN TVs!
- 不是大屏幕电视！

20:43.413 --> 20:45.448
OH, NO!
哦，不！

20:45.448 --> 20:49.344
- THE SUSPECT IS CONSIDERED
FAT, PINK, AND DANGEROUS.
- 嫌疑人被考虑
脂肪、粉红色且危险。

20:49.344 --> 20:52.413
- OH, NO!
GIANTER TVs!
- 哦，不！
巨型电视！

20:52.413 --> 20:53.620
HI-YA!
你好！

20:53.620 --> 20:54.931
[electricity crackling]
[电力噼啪声]

20:54.931 --> 20:57.000
- PULL IT TOGETHER, BUDDY.
- 团结起来，伙计。

20:57.000 --> 21:00.551
- I'’M TRYING TO, BUT THIS THING
HAS A MIND OF ITS OOOOOWN.
- 我正在尝试，但是这件事
有自己的想法。

21:00.551 --> 21:01.862
- WHOA!
OH.
- 哇！
哦。

21:01.862 --> 21:03.620
- YEEE-AH!
- 啊啊！

21:03.620 --> 21:05.862
[people screaming]
[人们尖叫]

21:05.862 --> 21:07.000
HI-YA!
HI-YA! YA!
你好！
你好！是啊！

21:07.000 --> 21:08.551
crash!
碰撞！

21:10.689 --> 21:12.517
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

21:12.517 --> 21:14.275
[sizzling]
[嘶嘶声]

21:14.275 --> 21:17.310
SPONGEBOB?
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？
海绵宝宝？

21:17.310 --> 21:19.137
[grunts]
SPONGEBOB?
[咕哝]
海绵宝宝？

21:19.137 --> 21:20.827
SPONGEBO--
海绵宝宝--

21:20.827 --> 21:23.793
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

21:23.793 --> 21:26.241
OH, NO!
哦，不！

21:26.241 --> 21:28.551
I-I'’M SO SORRY.
我-我很抱歉。

21:28.551 --> 21:30.379
MY BEST FRIEND,
我最好的朋友，

21:30.379 --> 21:32.827
CRUSHED BY ALL THIS RUBBLE,
被所有这​​些瓦砾压碎，

21:32.827 --> 21:37.793
ENTOMBED IN THIS CHEAP
PLASTIC BAG.
埋在这个便宜的地方
塑料袋。

21:37.793 --> 21:39.896
- THAT ISN'’T YOUR FRIEND,
YOU KELP FOR BRAINS.
- 那不是你的朋友，
你是大脑的海藻。

21:39.896 --> 21:42.000
THOSE ARE CLEANING SPONGES.
这些是清洁海绵。

21:42.000 --> 21:43.758
- SO I HAVEN'’T CRUSHED
THE LIFE
- 所以我还没有压垮
生活

21:43.758 --> 21:45.137
OUT OF MY BEST FRIEND
IN THE WORLD?
来自我最好的朋友
在世界上？

21:45.137 --> 21:48.689
- UM, I WOULDN'’T SAY THAT.
- 嗯，我不会这么说。

21:48.689 --> 21:50.482
- SPONGEBOB!
- 海绵宝宝！

21:50.482 --> 21:51.551
OH, NO!
哦，不！

21:51.551 --> 21:54.586
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

21:54.586 --> 21:56.310
[gasps]
[喘气]

21:56.310 --> 21:59.827
OH-OH,
I'’LL NEVER FORGIVE MYSELF!
哦-哦，
我永远不会原谅自己！

21:59.827 --> 22:03.241
NO!
I'’LL NEVER FORGIVE YOU!
不！
我永远不会原谅你！

22:03.241 --> 22:04.275
[groaning]
[呻吟]

22:04.275 --> 22:05.310
pop!
流行音乐！

22:05.310 --> 22:06.413
splurt!
发脾气！

22:06.413 --> 22:08.241
[somber music]
[忧郁的音乐]

22:08.241 --> 22:09.896
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

22:09.896 --> 22:12.310
- OH, HI, PATRICK.
WHAT DID I MISS?
- 哦，嗨，帕特里克。
我错过了什么？

22:12.310 --> 22:14.103
- SPONGEBOB, YOU'’RE OKAY!
- 海绵宝宝，你没事吧！

22:14.103 --> 22:16.724
- PATRICK!
YOUR ARM!
- 帕特里克！
你的手臂！

22:16.724 --> 22:18.000
- DON'’T WORRY, SPONGEBOB.
- 别担心，海绵宝宝。

22:18.000 --> 22:19.344
I'’M A SEA STAR.
我是海星。

22:19.344 --> 22:21.000
MY LIMBS GROW BACK.
我的四肢又长回来了。

22:21.000 --> 22:22.275
SEE?
看？

22:22.275 --> 22:23.965
- HOORAY FOR REGENERATION!
- 重生万岁！

22:23.965 --> 22:26.379
- AND IN THE SPIRIT
OF HEALING,
- 精神上
治愈，

22:26.379 --> 22:31.172
I VOW TO USE MY HANDS
ONLY TO JOIN THINGS TOGETHER,
我发誓要用我的双手
只是为了将事物结合在一起，

22:31.172 --> 22:33.413
STARTING HERE.
从这里开始。

22:33.413 --> 22:35.068
- HEY, GREAT JOB, PATRICK.
- 嘿，干得好，帕特里克。

22:35.068 --> 22:36.862
I LIKE
THE ARCHITECTURAL DETAIL.
我喜欢
建筑细节。

22:36.862 --> 22:37.896
- HI-YA!
- 你好！

22:37.896 --> 22:39.551
- PATRICK!
- 帕特里克！

22:39.551 --> 22:40.965
I THOUGHT
YOU GAVE UP CHOPPING.
我以为
你放弃了砍伐。

22:40.965 --> 22:43.000
- I DID.
- 我做到了。

22:43.000 --> 22:45.965
UNFORTUNATELY, WE SEA STARS
HAVE LIMBS THAT GROW NEW BODIES.
不幸的是，我们海星
拥有可以长出新身体的四肢。

22:45.965 --> 22:46.931
- HI-YA!
- 你好！

22:50.034 --> 22:51.103
[building rumbling]
[建筑物隆隆声]

22:54.827 --> 22:57.689
